Also `randomFreak` sets viewerLbl after render (render sets viewLbl again) — reorder fine either way since randomFreak calls render() first then overrides label. OK.

Also in randomFreak the `$('viewerLbl')` may be overwritten by render later; it's after. good.

Also `swoosh` — my tween math is convoluted/wrong: it calls orbit.dist change then lerp weirdly. Simplify: pulse zoom outward then decay. Rewrite swoosh:

```
function swoosh() {
  const d0 = orbit.dist;
  orbit.dist = Math.min(d0 * 1.09, 8.5);
  const target = RC.clamp(d0, 2.2, 8.5);
  RC.Tweens.add({ dur: .45, ease: RC.smooth, onUpdate: k => { orbit.dist = RC.lerp(orbit.dist_old...) } })
}
```
Simpler: capture dPulse = new bigger value; tween back to d0:
```
function swoosh() {
  const base = RC.clamp(orbit.dist, 2.2, 8.5);
  orbit.dist = base * 1.12;
  RC.Tweens.add({ dur: .4, onUpdate: k => { orbit.dist = RC.lerp(base * 1.12, base, k); }});
}

