Now main.js integration. Changes:

1. After W built & creator boot: `RC.creatorBoot(scene); RC.creatorOnConfirm(confirmCharacter);` and `RC.creatorSetMode = m => Cam.set(m);` `RC.creatorSfx = k => Audio[k] && Audio[k]();`.

2. Cam case 'creator'.

3. btnStart → openCreator instead of runMatch:
```
