Careful: player.chr.spec of old; RC.clearOutfit(chr) removes garment groups. Then dispose old group: RC.disposeTree(old.group) removes from parent & disposes geo — good instead of scene.remove.

But note old chr may be contestants array first entry — contestant object references same player obj. player variable already referenced in contestants. updatePlayerName.

5. makeContestant(isPlayer, name): spec: if isPlayer && RC.playerUberSpec → use it (clone!). Since buildRat clones spec internally (Object.assign({}, spec)) safe to reuse.

But note makeContestant also sets spec.hairStyle = pick random — would override saved spec's hairstyle. Only for non-player. Player path skip. Also limp etc preserved.

But careful in newGameKeepPlayer: it reuses pChr — player already has configured chr — fine.

